    <!-- Sample content for the widget-picker previews (res/layout/
         astraea_widget_preview_*.xml). These are never shown on a placed
         widget: the picker cannot run our RemoteViewsService, so the preview
         has to carry its own static data.

         Deliberately plausible-but-fictional: a preview showing the user's
         real calendar would leak event titles into the launcher's picker,
         which is a surface we neither control nor can clear. The time and
         header formats mirror what the providers actually render
         (AstraeaWidgetProviders.headerText, AstraeaWidgetService.formatTime)
         so the preview does not promise a layout the widget won't deliver. -->
